record lege-ecosystem.work.jp2lam-jpeg-2000-decoder-optimization-plan/1 : work {
    title "jp2lam JPEG 2000 Decoder Optimization Plan"
    state proposed
    intent """
        > Implementation update (2026-07-20): stage profiling, encoder-SIMD reuse,
        > single-tile copy removal, Tier-1 scratch reuse, native reduced-resolution
        > decode, direct packed renderer output, reusable decoder sessions, and
        > request-scoped worker budgets are implemented. See
        > `llm-docs/decode-optimization-results-2026-07-20.md`.
        >
        > Implementation update (2026-08-06): the 2026-08-05 audit's Phase 0-3 items
        > are already landed in code and the imported lege-ecosystem-perf audit
        > records are stale relative to it: packed Rgbx8/Bgra8 output formats,
        > lattice-aligned nonzero tile origins routed through the optimized inverse
        > DWT (reconstruct::lattice_aligned_origin), banded 9/7 inverse vertical
        > reconstruction (VERTICAL_BAND_COLS), Tier-1-fused irreversible dequant
        > with no separate full coefficient plane, multi-tile reduced-resolution
        > decode, thread-local Jp2Decoder sessions in the PDF renderer, and ROI
        > packet retention above the selected resolution. Phase 4 partially landed
        > this session: Tier-1 code-block decode now uses weighted
        > largest-processing-time (LPT) scheduling over a shared atomic work cursor,
        > with one persistent Tier1Scratch per pool worker via rayon::broadcast
        > (src/decode/t1.rs::decode_codeblocks_parallel). Output is bit-exact vs the
        > serial path (decode::tests::serial_and_budgeted_tier1_are_byte_identical;
        > full lib suite 339 passed). Genuinely remaining and profiling-gated: SIMD
        > dequant/store and final-sign-sweep elimination (Phase 4), true
        > windowed-ROI subband IDWT that avoids full-plane decode+crop (Phase 5),
        > and AVX2/NEON + PGO + optional GPU (Phase 6).
        """
    source {
        kind legacy
        path "lege-codecs/jp2lam/decode-fix-plan/decode-optimize.md"
    }
}

